sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant K as Kubernetes
    participant Op as Framework operator
    participant W as Worker pods
    participant GPU as GPUs
    U->>K: submit a training job custom resource
    K->>Op: the operator reconciles it
    Op->>W: create the ranks — one pod per worker
    Op->>W: inject the rendezvous config so ranks find each other
    W->>W: all ranks must start before any can proceed
    Note over Op,W: gang semantics — the operator exists mostly to get this right
    W->>GPU: train
    alt a rank dies
        Op->>W: restart the whole gang from the last checkpoint
    end
    Note over U,GPU: serving engines (vLLM, TensorRT-LLM) are the same pattern with a Deployment instead
